When logarithmic:
period = n, and invert=(p<0) (see comment on LinearAxisSpec).
bt ^ (mi * np) = cc * bc ^ x   <=>   mi * np ln bt = ln cc + x ln bc
<=> mi = (ln cc + x ln bc) / (np ln bt)
between ticks,   np ln bt = ln bc Dx
